  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_eb9e3638",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "查特先生在隧门事件后的演讲（节选一）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a937c2eb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "《致所有未曾归来的人》",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2163909c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "各位同胞，各位深空联合的同仁，星炬学院的师生，各位仍在拉海洛坚守的人们：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6036f15d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "今天，我们又一次站在了赫利俄斯的光辉之下。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d4ab3219",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "犹记上次我们集结于此，是为了纪念换日仪式的成功举办——那时我们第一次于拉海洛的天空点燃了人造太阳，并为这里的未来雀跃不已。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_431cf328",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "那时的我们未曾想到——就在几个月后，我们连续经历了史上最大规模的虚质磁暴，被迫启动了最终方案“夜幕”计划，以及直面鸣式阿列夫一的入侵。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2ea4216e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但如今我们已成功地击退了鸣式，封闭了隧门，跨过了罗伊神话中必将毁灭的黄昏纪元。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3d31c4df",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "是的，我们胜利了。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_004226fa",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这是一场前所未有的胜利，是可知战胜未知、人类战胜鸣式的胜利。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_35eee64b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但是作为深空联合的总负责人，我此刻却有义务向各位陈述这场胜利的代价：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bcb402e0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在过去的几个月里，拉海洛全境经历了近百次有记录的虚质磁暴，其中五次超过了最高警戒等级。我们于拉海洛建立的监测站、科研设施和防御节点，有共计超过三十处被摧毁；在搜索符文的过程中，我们失去了数量不计其数的机兵，十七位优秀的操作员因此受到虚质侵蚀，他们余生里将难以再次返回拉海洛。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aff9acdd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "最关键的，是我们失去了深空联合建立的基石——曾开辟拉海洛未来的隧者。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9c1887d2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "可这，却已经是在对抗虚无鸣式的漫长历史中，我们所取得的最辉煌的战果。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8d40dc75",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在这座全索拉里斯共同建设的探索前沿中，曾有无数先驱者在虚质磁暴中化为无形。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1167f453",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "那些记录他们频率的磁带，如今依然在保管间的最深处陈列着。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8077b692",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗德尔、昂辉、明夏、贝芙丽、巴伊切蒂奇——这些名字，你们中的许多人都听过。他们是最初的探索者，是第一批从索拉里斯各地奔赴极地的研究人员。同时，他们也是第一批尝试用记录战胜虚无，为我们解开风暴真相的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1595af0e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而在他们之前，甚至还有许多已无法找回磁带的人，永远留在了磁暴中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_25290edc",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "查特先生在隧门事件后的演讲（节选二）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e3ba1a92",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "今天，我在此陈述这些“代价”，是希望我们都能铭记：我们当下正在度过的这一刻，及往后将要到来的每一个明天，都是由漫长积累所引发的，一串连续的奇迹。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1e76aa24",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……我还记得，我来拉海洛赴任的第一场演讲，就是在罗德尔探索队的追悼仪式上。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_94fa6658",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "自那以后，我亲眼见证过许多优秀探索者们的“消失”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_671003b9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "可他们并不是名单上冰冷生硬的字符。他们留下的痕迹仍旧指引着我们迈出下一步。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c471da4d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊族群、黎那汐塔人、瑝珑人……来自索拉里斯各处的人们，即便身处虚无深处的最黑暗处，他们仍在抗拒着消解，仍走在向前探索的道路上。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4f7987ea",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_139677c2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b1edf45c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_092b8e90",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "再往后的事，相信诸位和我都已清楚——我们仍站在这里，即便虚无曾试图席卷整个拉海洛，我们仍站在这里。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 28,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 29,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5de54dc2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "是的，我们失去了很多。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 29,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 30,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8710559c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但此刻，我们仍站在这里，仍要继续向前迈进。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 30,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 31,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a6a19e0d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "阿列夫一试图让我们相信，一切都终将回归虚无，但是它错了。那段过去索拉里斯人发射的探测器所传回的，并不是单纯的白噪音或宇宙背景微波。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 31,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 32,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3f6bc273",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "那是我们跨越了百亿年仍能听见的，这个世界最初的声音——宇宙诞生的余晖。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 32,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 33,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_cf213eac",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "所以，存在过的事物，就一定会留下痕迹。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 33,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 34,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a6e29bbe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "深空联合不会停下脚步。我们终有一天会突破天空海，前往更广阔的世界。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 34,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 35,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9b482166",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "正如隧者所说：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 35,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 36,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a2c2700f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "愿我们于无垠的星海中，再会！",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 36,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 37,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}